# CASSCF: SA-3-CASSCF(2,2)/6-31G* for ethylene (pi, pi*)
basis           6-31g*
method          rhf
casscf          yes
closed          7
active          2
cassinglets     3
castargetmult   1
casscfmaxiter   200
precision       double
convthre        1e-8
charge          0
spinmult        1
gpus            1
coordinates     geom.xyz
